&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wimpy Mode</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Rescue</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Assist</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Die</a>
</pre>




</div>